      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like rutabaga tries to init vulkano without any new CLI args. You can see it in the TH run, even for the openwrt VM, which I assume has no GPU device.\n\n```\nopenwrt E 04-26 17:24:24  2787  2787 log_tee.cpp:155] [2024-04-26T17:24:24.754654329+00:00 ERROR rutabaga_gfx::rutabaga_gralloc::gralloc] failed to init Vulkano gralloc: SpecViolation(\"no matching VK devices available\")\n```\n\nProbably due to this line: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/crosvm/src/crosvm/sys/linux.rs;l\u003d2183;drc\u003dc223989d8457ecb2345a8d2831d8a1e599abcb0c\n\nThat aside, if Jiyong is OK with the binary size increase, I don\u0027t have any objections.",
